OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to hospital after
OL,4,ACoalisland arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fto be treated for smoke inhalation
OL,8,Ffollowing an arson attack in
OL,9,FCoalisland, in County Tyrone.
OL,11,FPolice said they received a report of a
OL,12,Fhouse fire in Ballynakilly Road at
OL,13,Fabout 01:40 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FThey added that officers attended the
OL,16,Fincident alongside colleagues from the
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,18,FService, and the fire was extinguished.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
