OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to hospital after
OL,4,ACoalisland arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said "all those inside the
OL,7,Fproperty were able to get out, and one
OL,8,Fperson was taken onward to hospital to
OL,9,Fbe treated for smoke inhalation".
